  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 4(b): average precision@k per domain, over k = 5, 10, 15, 20. The same fourteen domain series and the same thirteen teams as panel (a), on the same 0-to-0.8 axis, with no printed values. The bars are lower throughout — most teams peak between 0.4 and 0.6 rather than 0.6 and 0.7 — and the ordering within a team's group differs from the recall panel: architecture (arc, blue) is the tallest bar for most teams here, where computer science led on recall. RUC Team's social sciences (sow) bar is the tallest single bar at about 0.61, and DUTIR831's architecture bar reaches about 0.67.",
